OL,3,GNEWSAWorcester market traders 'gutted'
OL,4,Aas operator quits
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders at a city centre market said
OL,7,Fthey feel "heartbroken" after their
OL,8,Foperator pulled out, leaving the future
OL,9,Fof the site uncertain.
OL,11,FCotswold Markets will stop running
OL,12,FWorcester's specialised food and arts
OL,13,Fand crafts markets at the end of this
OL,14,Fyear, citing falling profits.
OL,16,FWorcester City Council said it was
OL,17,Ftrying to find a new operator, while
OL,18,Fstallholders said they would be
OL,19,F"gutted" if the market could not be
OL,20,Fsaved.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
