OL,3,GNEWSAWorcester market traders 'gutted'
OL,4,Aas operator quits
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Adrian Gregson said: "The
OL,7,Fspecialist markets bring variety and
OL,8,Ffreshness to the city. We're keen to
OL,9,Fsee them continue."
